{"id":"forecast-17","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-17/audio-1.mp3","model":"small","duration":459.99,"segments":[{"start":1.23,"end":5.31,"text":"IELTS Listening, version 56337.","words":[["IELTS",1.23,2.09],["Listening,",2.09,2.45],["version",3.01,3.31],["56337.",3.31,5.31]]},{"start":6.31,"end":11.67,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what","words":[["You",6.31,6.75],["will",6.75,6.95],["hear",6.95,7.15],["a",7.15,7.33],["number",7.33,7.67],["of",7.67,7.93],["different",7.93,8.23],["recordings,",8.23,8.83],["and",9.43,9.69],["you",9.69,9.85],["will",9.85,9.95],["have",9.95,10.13],["to",10.13,10.27],["answer",10.27,10.55],["questions",10.55,11.11],["on",11.11,11.47],["what",11.47,11.67]]},{"start":11.67,"end":12.21,"text":"you hear.","words":[["you",11.67,11.87],["hear.",11.87,12.21]]},{"start":13.13,"end":18.19,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance","words":[["There",13.13,13.41],["will",13.41,13.55],["be",13.55,13.71],["time",13.71,14.03],["for",14.03,14.25],["you",14.25,14.39],["to",14.39,14.47],["read",14.47,14.79],["the",14.79,15.07],["instructions",15.07,15.63],["and",15.63,15.97],["questions,",15.97,16.35],["and",16.85,17.29],["you",17.29,17.47],["will",17.47,17.59],["have",17.59,17.77],["a",17.77,17.91],["chance",17.91,18.19]]},{"start":18.19,"end":19.29,"text":"to check your work.","words":[["to",18.19,18.41],["check",18.41,18.75],["your",18.75,18.95],["work.",18.95,19.29]]},{"start":20.47,"end":23.55,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["All",20.47,20.79],["the",20.79,20.95],["recordings",20.95,21.37],["will",21.37,21.77],["be",21.77,21.91],["played",21.91,22.35],["once",22.35,22.79],["only.",22.79,23.55]]},{"start":25.03,"end":27.71,"text":"The test is in four parts.","words":[["The",25.03,25.35],["test",25.35,25.77],["is",25.77,26.51],["in",26.51,26.65],["four",26.65,27.03],["parts.",27.03,27.71]]},{"start":27.71,"end":31.89,"text":"Write all your answers in the listening question booklet.","words":[["Write",27.71,28.83],["all",28.83,29.15],["your",29.15,29.33],["answers",29.33,29.75],["in",29.75,30.37],["the",30.37,30.51],["listening",30.51,30.89],["question",30.89,31.39],["booklet.",31.39,31.89]]},{"start":32.53,"end":38.73,"text":"At the end of the test, you will be given 10 minutes to transfer your answers to an answer sheet.","words":[["At",32.53,33.19],["the",33.19,33.33],["end",33.33,33.51],["of",33.51,33.63],["the",33.63,33.73],["test,",33.73,34.09],["you",34.51,34.77],["will",34.77,34.91],["be",34.91,35.05],["given",35.05,35.33],["10",35.33,35.75],["minutes",35.75,36.11],["to",36.11,36.47],["transfer",36.47,36.99],["your",36.99,37.23],["answers",37.23,37.63],["to",37.63,37.91],["an",37.91,38.09],["answer",38.09,38.39],["sheet.",38.39,38.73]]},{"start":40.81,"end":44.59,"text":"Now turn to part 1 on page 2 of your question booklet.","words":[["Now",40.81,41.17],["turn",41.17,41.39],["to",41.39,41.59],["part",41.59,41.81],["1",41.81,42.17],["on",42.17,42.65],["page",42.65,42.99],["2",42.99,43.45],["of",43.45,43.63],["your",43.63,43.73],["question",43.73,44.07],["booklet.",44.07,44.59]]},{"start":50.04,"end":50.86,"text":"Part 1","words":[["Part",50.04,50.28],["1",50.28,50.86]]},{"start":51.86,"end":56.68,"text":"You will hear a woman talking to a man about hiring a room for a party.","words":[["You",51.86,52.2],["will",52.2,52.4],["hear",52.4,52.6],["a",52.6,52.78],["woman",52.78,53.08],["talking",53.08,53.62],["to",53.62,53.9],["a",53.9,54.08],["man",54.08,54.34],["about",54.34,54.7],["hiring",54.7,55.18],["a",55.18,55.44],["room",55.44,55.84],["for",55.84,56.12],["a",56.12,56.3],["party.",56.3,56.68]]},{"start":57.98,"end":61.92,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 1 to 7.","words":[["First",57.98,58.66],["you",58.66,58.88],["have",58.88,59.06],["some",59.06,59.26],["time",59.26,59.7],["to",59.7,60.0],["look",60.0,60.16],["at",60.16,60.3],["questions",60.3,60.72],["1",60.72,61.26],["to",61.26,61.48],["7.",61.48,61.92]]},{"start":61.92,"end":100.86,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to seven.","words":[["Now",61.92,62.82],["listen",97.44,97.94],["carefully",97.94,98.44],["and",98.44,98.82],["answer",98.82,99.28],["questions",99.28,99.88],["one",99.88,100.24],["to",100.24,100.46],["seven.",100.46,100.86]]},{"start":104.44,"end":107.1,"text":"Good morning, the function company. Can I help you?","words":[["Good",104.44,104.9],["morning,",104.9,105.22],["the",105.4,105.5],["function",105.5,105.78],["company.",105.78,106.32],["Can",106.52,106.66],["I",106.66,106.76],["help",106.76,106.9],["you?",106.9,107.1]]},{"start":107.48,"end":113.14,"text":"Hi. A friend told me that you can arrange rooms for hire for parties and things like that.","words":[["Hi.",107.48,107.86],["A",108.42,108.58],["friend",108.58,108.8],["told",108.8,109.08],["me",109.08,109.24],["that",109.24,109.4],["you",109.4,109.56],["can",109.56,109.72],["arrange",109.72,109.98],["rooms",109.98,110.36],["for",110.36,110.64],["hire",110.64,110.9],["for",110.9,111.28],["parties",111.28,111.96],["and",111.96,112.4],["things",112.4,112.66],["like",112.66,112.88],["that.",112.88,113.14]]},{"start":113.54,"end":119.46,"text":"That's right. We have about ten hotels on our list and we hire out function rooms on their behalf.","words":[["That's",113.54,113.98],["right.",113.98,114.2],["We",114.6,114.8],["have",114.8,115.02],["about",115.02,115.22],["ten",115.22,115.56],["hotels",115.56,116.14],["on",116.14,116.4],["our",116.4,116.54],["list",116.54,116.92],["and",116.92,117.24],["we",117.24,117.42],["hire",117.42,117.7],["out",117.7,117.9],["function",117.9,118.26],["rooms",118.26,118.7],["on",118.7,118.88],["their",118.88,119.08],["behalf.",119.08,119.46]]},{"start":120.04,"end":120.94,"text":"Are you having a party?","words":[["Are",120.04,120.26],["you",120.26,120.38],["having",120.38,120.56],["a",120.56,120.7],["party?",120.7,120.94]]},{"start":121.62,"end":124.98,"text":"Yes. It's for my birthday. My twenty first.","words":[["Yes.",121.62,122.0],["It's",122.44,122.68],["for",122.68,122.84],["my",122.84,123.0],["birthday.",123.0,123.44],["My",124.08,124.28],["twenty",124.28,124.6],["first.",124.6,124.98]]},{"start":125.62,"end":129.5,"text":"Okay. First of all, can you tell me how many people you're inviting?","words":[["Okay.",125.62,126.1],["First",126.66,127.02],["of",127.02,127.22],["all,",127.22,127.44],["can",127.58,127.68],["you",127.68,127.78],["tell",127.78,127.98],["me",127.98,128.14],["how",128.14,128.32],["many",128.32,128.5],["people",128.5,128.9],["you're",128.9,129.14],["inviting?",129.14,129.5]]},{"start":130.2,"end":133.06,"text":"I'm not sure yet. It depends on the cost.","words":[["I'm",130.2,130.58],["not",130.58,130.72],["sure",130.72,131.06],["yet.",131.06,131.48],["It",131.8,132.08],["depends",132.08,132.36],["on",132.36,132.58],["the",132.58,132.7],["cost.",132.7,133.06]]},{"start":133.56,"end":138.1,"text":"Okay. Well, the exchange hotel might be a good choice for you.","words":[["Okay.",133.56,134.04],["Well,",134.68,134.82],["the",134.98,135.1],["exchange",135.1,135.66],["hotel",135.66,136.2],["might",136.2,136.64],["be",136.64,136.82],["a",136.82,136.96],["good",136.96,137.12],["choice",137.12,137.54],["for",137.54,137.84],["you.",137.84,138.1]]},{"start":138.48,"end":144.1,"text":"They have a room which will seat up to 45 and will take 65 people standing.","words":[["They",138.48,138.7],["have",138.7,138.92],["a",138.92,139.02],["room",139.02,139.28],["which",139.28,139.52],["will",139.52,139.7],["seat",139.7,139.96],["up",139.96,140.2],["to",140.2,140.36],["45",140.36,141.04],["and",141.04,141.9],["will",141.9,142.14],["take",142.14,142.42],["65",142.42,143.06],["people",143.06,143.52],["standing.",143.52,144.1]]},{"start":144.9,"end":147.04,"text":"Are you going to have a meal or just a buffet?","words":[["Are",144.9,145.06],["you",145.06,145.16],["going",145.16,145.34],["to",145.34,145.5],["have",145.5,145.64],["a",145.64,145.74],["meal",145.74,145.98],["or",145.98,146.42],["just",146.42,146.72],["a",146.72,146.88],["buffet?",146.88,147.04]]},{"start":148.08,"end":151.92,"text":"I think a buffet. It doesn't have to be a sit-down meal.","words":[["I",148.08,148.56],["think",148.56,149.04],["a",149.04,149.22],["buffet.",149.22,149.52],["It",150.22,150.44],["doesn't",150.44,150.66],["have",150.66,150.82],["to",150.82,150.96],["be",150.96,151.08],["a",151.08,151.22],["sit",151.22,151.38],["-down",151.38,151.6],["meal.",151.6,151.92]]},{"start":151.92,"end":157.0,"text":"I don't know the exchange hotel. Can you tell me a bit more about it?","words":[["I",151.92,152.94],["don't",152.94,153.16],["know",153.16,153.38],["the",153.38,153.64],["exchange",153.64,154.1],["hotel.",154.1,154.56],["Can",155.14,155.62],["you",155.62,155.72],["tell",155.72,155.9],["me",155.9,156.06],["a",156.06,156.16],["bit",156.16,156.24],["more",156.24,156.42],["about",156.42,156.68],["it?",156.68,157.0]]},{"start":157.5,"end":163.72,"text":"Well, it was built about 150 years ago. We regularly arrange parties there. They have","words":[["Well,",157.5,157.92],["it",158.06,158.18],["was",158.18,158.4],["built",158.4,158.72],["about",158.72,159.12],["150",159.12,159.82],["years",159.82,160.3],["ago.",160.3,160.64],["We",161.08,161.24],["regularly",161.24,161.74],["arrange",161.74,162.04],["parties",162.04,162.56],["there.",162.56,162.86],["They",163.14,163.48],["have",163.48,163.72]]},{"start":163.72,"end":169.0,"text":"a room for hire on the fifth floor. It's not the most central hotel, but it's very easy","words":[["a",163.72,163.82],["room",163.82,164.04],["for",164.04,164.24],["hire",164.24,164.48],["on",164.48,164.7],["the",164.7,164.82],["fifth",164.82,165.12],["floor.",165.12,165.5],["It's",166.12,166.52],["not",166.52,166.72],["the",166.72,166.88],["most",166.88,167.02],["central",167.02,167.38],["hotel,",167.38,167.86],["but",168.1,168.22],["it's",168.22,168.44],["very",168.44,168.7],["easy",168.7,169.0]]},{"start":169.0,"end":174.0,"text":"for people to find. It's very popular for wedding parties, so I'll have to check if","words":[["for",169.0,169.16],["people",169.16,169.34],["to",169.34,169.5],["find.",169.5,169.86],["It's",170.44,170.9],["very",170.9,171.18],["popular",171.18,171.6],["for",171.6,171.88],["wedding",171.88,172.18],["parties,",172.18,172.82],["so",172.98,173.16],["I'll",173.16,173.32],["have",173.32,173.46],["to",173.46,173.6],["check",173.6,173.86],["if",173.86,174.0]]},{"start":174.0,"end":174.5,"text":"it's available.","words":[["it's",174.0,174.16],["available.",174.16,174.5]]},{"start":175.06,"end":178.5,"text":"OK. Is the room nice? Have you seen it?","words":[["OK.",175.06,175.5],["Is",176.08,176.34],["the",176.34,176.46],["room",176.46,176.64],["nice?",176.64,176.96],["Have",177.58,177.84],["you",177.84,178.0],["seen",178.0,178.3],["it?",178.3,178.5]]},{"start":178.5,"end":184.74,"text":"I have. It's quite big and very light, but the best thing is that it has a wonderful view.","words":[["I",178.5,179.14],["have.",179.14,179.42],["It's",179.74,180.12],["quite",180.12,180.36],["big",180.36,180.68],["and",180.68,180.96],["very",180.96,181.18],["light,",181.18,181.62],["but",181.76,182.18],["the",182.18,182.34],["best",182.34,182.66],["thing",182.66,182.98],["is",182.98,183.34],["that",183.34,183.48],["it",183.48,183.58],["has",183.58,183.7],["a",183.7,183.82],["wonderful",183.82,184.24],["view.",184.24,184.74]]},{"start":185.08,"end":187.08,"text":"On a fine evening, you can see for miles.","words":[["On",185.08,185.24],["a",185.24,185.34],["fine",185.34,185.6],["evening,",185.6,185.98],["you",186.12,186.18],["can",186.18,186.32],["see",186.32,186.54],["for",186.54,186.72],["miles.",186.72,187.08]]},{"start":187.68,"end":190.9,"text":"Oh, sounds good. How much is it?","words":[["Oh,",187.68,188.06],["sounds",188.06,188.4],["good.",188.4,188.8],["How",189.64,190.1],["much",190.1,190.46],["is",190.46,190.66],["it?",190.66,190.9]]},{"start":191.46,"end":197.12,"text":"It's £32 a head. That includes the higher of the room and the standard buffet, but","words":[["It's",191.46,191.74],["£32",191.74,192.2],["a",192.2,192.86],["head.",192.86,193.22],["That",193.5,193.76],["includes",193.76,194.1],["the",194.1,194.4],["higher",194.4,194.68],["of",194.68,194.84],["the",194.84,194.96],["room",194.96,195.26],["and",195.26,195.68],["the",195.68,195.86],["standard",195.86,196.16],["buffet,",196.16,196.6],["but",196.96,197.12]]},{"start":197.12,"end":200.66,"text":"not drinks. And you have to have at least 35 guests.","words":[["not",197.12,197.42],["drinks.",197.42,197.8],["And",198.42,198.74],["you",198.74,198.86],["have",198.86,198.96],["to",198.96,199.08],["have",199.08,199.24],["at",199.24,199.38],["least",199.38,199.64],["35",199.64,200.26],["guests.",200.26,200.66]]},{"start":201.06,"end":206.32,"text":"Well, that won't be a problem. We're likely to be more than that. Can you tell me when","words":[["Well,",201.06,201.42],["that",201.64,201.88],["won't",201.88,202.08],["be",202.08,202.22],["a",202.22,202.34],["problem.",202.34,202.68],["We're",203.16,203.4],["likely",203.4,203.66],["to",203.66,203.86],["be",203.86,203.98],["more",203.98,204.14],["than",204.14,204.32],["that.",204.32,204.58],["Can",205.28,205.68],["you",205.68,205.8],["tell",205.8,205.98],["me",205.98,206.12],["when",206.12,206.32]]},{"start":206.32,"end":206.88,"text":"it's available?","words":[["it's",206.32,206.52],["available?",206.52,206.88]]},{"start":206.88,"end":210.82,"text":"I can check that for you. Which dates are you looking at?","words":[["I",206.88,207.76],["can",207.76,208.02],["check",208.02,208.36],["that",208.36,208.52],["for",208.52,208.8],["you.",208.8,209.12],["Which",209.28,209.66],["dates",209.66,209.98],["are",209.98,210.16],["you",210.16,210.22],["looking",210.22,210.42],["at?",210.42,210.82]]},{"start":212.04,"end":216.18,"text":"Ideally the middle to end of April. Weekends.","words":[["Ideally",212.04,212.74],["the",212.74,213.28],["middle",213.28,213.64],["to",213.64,213.98],["end",213.98,214.3],["of",214.3,214.46],["April.",214.46,214.92],["Weekends.",215.48,216.18]]},{"start":216.6,"end":224.6,"text":"Let me see. They can do any Saturday in April, but not Fridays or Sundays.","words":[["Let",216.6,216.76],["me",216.76,216.88],["see.",216.88,217.26],["They",219.54,220.24],["can",220.24,220.44],["do",220.44,220.64],["any",220.64,220.98],["Saturday",220.98,221.46],["in",221.46,221.98],["April,",221.98,222.32],["but",222.32,222.96],["not",222.96,223.32],["Fridays",223.32,223.96],["or",223.96,224.3],["Sundays.",224.3,224.6]]},{"start":225.5,"end":229.82,"text":"Okay. But if I want something bigger, what would you recommend?","words":[["Okay.",225.5,226.0],["But",226.9,227.2],["if",227.2,227.52],["I",227.52,227.64],["want",227.64,227.76],["something",227.76,228.02],["bigger,",228.02,228.56],["what",228.94,229.14],["would",229.14,229.28],["you",229.28,229.42],["recommend?",229.42,229.82]]},{"start":230.74,"end":232.24,"text":"There's the Limerick Hotel.","words":[["There's",230.74,231.18],["the",231.18,231.34],["Limerick",231.34,231.84],["Hotel.",231.84,232.24]]},{"start":232.68,"end":235.6,"text":"How do you spell that? I'm taking notes.","words":[["How",232.68,233.2],["do",233.2,233.32],["you",233.32,233.44],["spell",233.44,233.72],["that?",233.72,234.0],["I'm",234.42,234.92],["taking",234.92,235.16],["notes.",235.16,235.6]]},{"start":235.6,"end":247.8,"text":"It's L-I-M-E-R-I-C-K. There's a large room there which seats up to 75 people, or there's","words":[["It's",235.6,236.64],["L",236.64,237.1],["-I",237.1,237.5],["-M",237.5,238.22],["-E",238.22,239.1],["-R",239.1,239.68],["-I",239.68,240.5],["-C",240.5,240.88],["-K.",240.88,241.38],["There's",242.16,242.86],["a",242.86,242.96],["large",242.96,243.36],["room",243.36,243.88],["there",243.88,244.24],["which",244.24,244.62],["seats",244.62,244.94],["up",244.94,245.18],["to",245.18,245.34],["75",245.34,245.94],["people,",245.94,246.52],["or",246.82,247.42],["there's",247.42,247.8]]},{"start":247.8,"end":250.18,"text":"room for 125 standing.","words":[["room",247.8,248.02],["for",248.02,248.2],["125",248.2,249.12],["standing.",249.12,250.18]]},{"start":250.86,"end":254.16,"text":"Oh, I expect we'll be standing. Where is it?","words":[["Oh,",250.86,251.14],["I",251.24,251.42],["expect",251.42,251.7],["we'll",251.7,251.92],["be",251.92,252.04],["standing.",252.04,252.46],["Where",253.26,253.7],["is",253.7,253.94],["it?",253.94,254.16]]},{"start":254.74,"end":260.4,"text":"It's in the business district, so public transport's good. It's got a large car park, too, though.","words":[["It's",254.74,255.14],["in",255.14,255.24],["the",255.24,255.34],["business",255.34,255.6],["district,",255.6,256.14],["so",256.14,256.58],["public",256.58,256.92],["transport's",256.92,257.56],["good.",257.56,257.84],["It's",258.48,258.82],["got",258.82,258.94],["a",258.94,259.04],["large",259.04,259.28],["car",259.28,259.5],["park,",259.5,259.88],["too,",260.08,260.14],["though.",260.28,260.4]]},{"start":260.82,"end":264.28,"text":"The room's on the ground floor, and it's recently been refurbished.","words":[["The",260.82,261.14],["room's",261.14,261.44],["on",261.44,261.52],["the",261.52,261.62],["ground",261.62,261.92],["floor,",261.92,262.36],["and",262.36,262.86],["it's",262.86,263.08],["recently",263.08,263.36],["been",263.36,263.62],["refurbished.",263.62,264.28]]},{"start":264.28,"end":267.4,"text":"Is there a garden we could use if we're on the ground floor?","words":[["Is",264.28,265.06],["there",265.06,265.24],["a",265.24,265.36],["garden",265.36,265.6],["we",265.6,265.82],["could",265.82,265.98],["use",265.98,266.3],["if",266.3,266.56],["we're",266.56,266.68],["on",266.68,266.76],["the",266.76,266.88],["ground",266.88,267.1],["floor?",267.1,267.4]]},{"start":267.94,"end":269.9,"text":"There's a small one that would be available.","words":[["There's",267.94,268.22],["a",268.22,268.34],["small",268.34,268.72],["one",268.72,269.12],["that",269.12,269.24],["would",269.24,269.34],["be",269.34,269.5],["available.",269.5,269.9]]},{"start":270.46,"end":275.62,"text":"Sounds nice. Especially if it's a warm evening. And the cost?","words":[["Sounds",270.46,270.92],["nice.",270.92,271.52],["Especially",272.08,272.56],["if",272.56,272.86],["it's",272.86,272.96],["a",272.96,273.06],["warm",273.06,273.24],["evening.",273.24,273.62],["And",274.22,274.84],["the",274.84,275.16],["cost?",275.16,275.62]]},{"start":276.14,"end":281.64,"text":"The buffet is £36 per person. Shall I check availability in April for you?","words":[["The",276.14,276.28],["buffet",276.28,276.6],["is",276.6,277.1],["£36",277.1,277.72],["per",277.72,278.32],["person.",278.32,278.84],["Shall",279.52,279.74],["I",279.74,279.88],["check",279.88,280.06],["availability",280.06,280.54],["in",280.54,280.94],["April",280.94,281.18],["for",281.18,281.44],["you?",281.44,281.64]]},{"start":282.1,"end":282.68,"text":"Yes, please.","words":[["Yes,",282.1,282.4],["please.",282.44,282.68]]},{"start":283.2,"end":286.54,"text":"Okay. You said weekends, didn't you?","words":[["Okay.",283.2,283.76],["You",284.66,285.12],["said",285.12,285.4],["weekends,",285.4,285.9],["didn't",286.12,286.36],["you?",286.36,286.54]]},{"start":286.92,"end":287.28,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",286.92,287.28]]},{"start":288.2,"end":295.1,"text":"No Fridays again. And it's not free on the first Saturday. That's the sixth. But it's","words":[["No",288.2,288.76],["Fridays",288.76,289.3],["again.",289.3,289.78],["And",290.18,290.54],["it's",290.54,290.78],["not",290.78,291.06],["free",291.06,291.44],["on",291.44,291.62],["the",291.62,291.74],["first",291.74,292.18],["Saturday.",292.18,292.84],["That's",293.36,293.6],["the",293.6,293.72],["sixth.",293.72,294.16],["But",294.7,294.92],["it's",294.92,295.1]]},{"start":295.1,"end":298.14,"text":"free on the thirteenth and twentieth. Thank you.","words":[["free",295.1,295.28],["on",295.28,295.42],["the",295.42,295.54],["thirteenth",295.54,296.1],["and",296.1,296.52],["twentieth.",296.52,296.98],["Thank",297.36,297.78],["you.",297.78,298.14]]},{"start":302.02,"end":307.66,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 8 to","words":[["Before",302.02,302.32],["you",302.32,302.58],["hear",302.58,302.9],["the",302.9,303.08],["rest",303.08,303.36],["of",303.36,303.48],["the",303.48,303.58],["conversation,",303.58,304.18],["you",304.86,305.04],["have",305.04,305.24],["some",305.24,305.44],["time",305.44,305.86],["to",305.86,306.14],["look",306.14,306.3],["at",306.3,306.46],["questions",306.46,306.82],["8",306.82,307.44],["to",307.44,307.66]]},{"start":307.66,"end":326.62,"text":"10. Now listen and answer questions 8 to 10.","words":[["10.",307.66,308.06],["Now",323.28,323.52],["listen",323.52,323.88],["and",323.88,324.34],["answer",324.34,324.84],["questions",324.84,325.28],["8",325.28,325.98],["to",325.98,326.16],["10.",326.16,326.62]]},{"start":326.98,"end":334.81,"text":"I think the first hotel looks best for me, but I need two or three days to think about","words":[["I",326.98,327.14],["think",330.53,330.63],["the",330.63,330.79],["first",330.79,331.11],["hotel",331.11,331.55],["looks",331.55,331.81],["best",331.81,332.03],["for",332.03,332.25],["me,",332.25,332.45],["but",332.53,332.71],["I",332.71,332.91],["need",332.91,333.11],["two",333.11,333.41],["or",333.41,333.53],["three",333.53,333.77],["days",333.77,334.07],["to",334.07,334.33],["think",334.33,334.53],["about",334.53,334.81]]},{"start":334.81,"end":335.11,"text":"it.","words":[["it.",334.81,335.11]]},{"start":335.11,"end":340.57,"text":"OK, well if I take your booking today I can hold it for a week, so if you want to change","words":[["OK,",335.11,335.73],["well",336.11,336.39],["if",336.39,336.63],["I",336.63,336.75],["take",336.75,336.93],["your",336.93,337.09],["booking",337.09,337.29],["t